chniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"},{\"api_id\":\"cat-books\",\"description\":\"Bring your reading to life by joining a book club or hearing an author talk in person.\",\"event_count\":725,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/n0/5147e1e9-00cd-4ea1-86e9-e9b9ebd34ae6.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/3g/f33c0b3c-9090-40bb-b99c-875b534bcee4.png\",\"name\":\"Books\",\"page_title\":\"Book Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/rw/4ea6d3ba-0ad3-44d1-ba37-bcaab65051af.png\",\"slug\":\"books\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/bi/d328b247-9ac7-4ac1-9955-50ec16669bec.png\",\"subscriber_count\":1705,\"tint_color\":\"#D5AD37\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":null,\"is_free\":true,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":false,\"spots_remaining\":1,\"is_near_capacity\":true,\"require_approval\":true},\"registration_availability\":\"open\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":false,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#77b3b4\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":false,\"font_title\":\"new-spirit\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"It's time for another Ukrainian Book Swap! This time, after our signature swap, we'll have an optional discussion of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"The Book of Emil\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\" by Illarion Pavlyuk (now available only in Ukrainian, sorry).\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"How it works:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"📖 Bring one paper book in Ukrainian or by a Ukrainian author, and take another home with you. Be ready to say a few words about the book you brought — and a little about yourself.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"How it will happen:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Part 1\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" — We introduce ourselves and the books we brought, then swap them.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Part 2\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" — We share our impressions of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"The Book of Emil\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\" by Illarion Pavlyuk.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Format:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"A friendly circle where everyone gets a chance to join the conversation about great literature.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You don't need to have read \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"The Book of Emil\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\" to join, - that part is completely optional. And you don't need to bring a paperback of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"The Book of Emil\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\" by Illarion Pavlyuk book either.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Language:\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Ukrainian and English.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Dobre Together is a space for meaningful time with good people. We don't have a physical home (yet — we're dreaming of one!), but we create warmth wherever we gather. No chasing numbers, just quality time with good people 🥰💛💙\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"https://www.instagram.com/dobre_together/\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/dobre_together/\"}}]}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":false,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":null}",
