nd wellness brands.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"RSVPing is the only way to truly secure your spot. Walk ins are subject to capacity.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Come and shop clothes that are good from your health, including organic cotton, wool, and fibres that release minerals into your skin as you wear them. Get fashion made polyester free.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Brand Line Up\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Yusun the label\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Sariva Rozen\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Plain and Simple\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Hyli\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Aefen London\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"India Grace London\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Zubek\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Margen Atelier\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Julie May\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Valentina Karellas\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Laine Hill\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"House of Ador\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"FAQ\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Do I need to register to attend? \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"We accept walk ins but we highly recommend RSVPing as we may have to turn walk ins away if we are above capacity\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"What's the address?: \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"Fabrica X, 36-40 York Way, N1 9AB.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"What are the opening hours? \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"9am-6pm on September 25th, 26th, and 27th.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"How can I get free non toxic goodies?\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" Be in the first 50 attendees on any day.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":false,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":null}",
