bf0-87cf-403d-989f-d8d67760658d.png\",\"bio_short\":\"A life well-lived. More than just beautiful buildings.\",\"first_name\":\"\",\"last_name\":\"\",\"instagram_handle\":\"masonfifth\",\"is_verified\":false,\"linkedin_handle\":null,\"name\":\"Mason & Fifth\",\"tiktok_handle\":null,\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"twitter_handle\":null,\"username\":\"masonfifth\",\"website\":null,\"youtube_handle\":null}],\"referred_by\":null,\"cover_image\":{\"colors\":[\"#131313\",\"#b1b1b1\"],\"palette\":{\"neutral\":[{\"color\":\"#131313\",\"percentage\":26.73},{\"color\":\"#b7b7b7\",\"percentage\":15.85},{\"color\":\"#a7a7a7\",\"percentage\":9.53}],\"vibrant\":[]}},\"cover_video\":null,\"social_image\":{\"cdn_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/event-social/it/2c9da3c9-d760-4492-bc24-d24b7beaec48.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630,\"mime_type\":\"image/png\"},\"social_video\":null,\"sessions\":[],\"ticket_types\":[{\"api_id\":\"ttype-nwrhDzQj1glyWeG\",\"cents\":null,\"currency\":null,\"description\":null,\"ethereum_token_requirements\":[],\"event_api_id\":\"evt-l8VDJVGACKki0Tu\",\"is_flexible\":false,\"is_hidden\":false,\"max_capacity\":null,\"max_per_guest\":null,\"membership_restriction\":null,\"min_cents\":null,\"position\":\"8\",\"name\":\"Standard\",\"require_approval\":false,\"tint_color\":null,\"type\":\"free\",\"valid_end_at\":null,\"valid_start_at\":null,\"num_tickets_registered\":15,\"num_guests\":15,\"spots_remaining\":null,\"is_disabled\":false}],\"featured_infos\":[],\"categories\":[{\"api_id\":\"cat-AzVAf6VmE9JEre4\",\"description\":\"Whether it’s painting workshops or pottery classes, join an event to unleash your creativity, learn new techniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":null,\"is_free\":true,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":true,\"spots_remaining\":0,\"is_near_capacity\":false,\"require_approval\":false},\"registration_availability\":\"waitlist\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#131313\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":false,\"font_title\":\"snpro\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Join us at Mason & Fifth for an intimate screening and conversation with British-Nigerian filmmaker, writer, curator and Founder and Director of DAILIES, Tomisin Adepeju\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\".\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"The evening will centre on a screening of Tomisin’s short film \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"Lift Me Up\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\", which screened at the Edinburgh International Film Festival, followed by a wide-ranging conversation about his journey as a filmmaker, the craft of screenwriting and directing, and the ideas that continue to shape his work.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Rather than a traditional Q&A at the end, the audience will be woven into the conversation throughout, creating a more open and intimate exchange around Tomisin’s work and the wider questions it raises.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"We’ll explore Tomisin’s relationship with Nigeria and Britain, his decision to embrace a distinctly African aesthetic, the question of what it means to identify as a Nigerian filmmaker, and how culture, memory and place find their way into his films. The conversation will also move into visual language, working with actors, developing character, building a body of work, and the wider landscape of contemporary African cinema.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Alongside his filmmaking, Tomisin is the Founder and Director of \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"DAILIES\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\", a screening and discussion platform built around cinema, craft and community. Through DAILIES, he has curated sold-out programmes at BFI Southbank, Rich Mix and other venues, bringing filmmakers and audiences together for in-depth conversations around the ideas and processes behind their work.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Tomisin’s award-winning short films have screened at more than 150 festivals internationally, including Sundance, BFI London Film Festival and London Short Film Festival. He has recently completed \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"It’s Dancing Time\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"text\":\" for BBC Film and is currently developing his debut feature with Ken Loach’s Sixteen Films and the BFI. His writing has appeared in MUBI Notebook, BFI and other publications.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"‘Lift Me Up’ Synopsis\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"On the eve of her husband’s birthday, Esther struggles to come to terms with an impending event.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Screening and conversation hosted by Leon Rehman, with the audience woven in throughout the evening.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":true,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":null}",
