4-b82b-80b0ba3ec2f0.png\",\"name\":\"AI\",\"page_title\":\"AI Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/2g/4121b0fa-bd9e-4a50-ad85-cf0000b6d919.png\",\"slug\":\"ai\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/c1/486065e1-2511-4577-a0e0-5eb683d38a3d.png\",\"subscriber_count\":102003,\"tint_color\":\"#D96D9B\"},{\"api_id\":\"cat-AzVAf6VmE9JEre4\",\"description\":\"Whether it’s painting workshops or pottery classes, join an event to unleash your creativity, learn new techniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"},{\"api_id\":\"cat-fooddrink\",\"description\":\"From morning coffee to late night pizza, enjoy great food and drinks with old and new friends.\",\"event_count\":602,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/xv/2dd876d6-775a-4cec-adba-9d9e94d814a6.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/36/a77db635-cb3b-4720-9758-2bc9dae948e4.png\",\"name\":\"Food & Drink\",\"page_title\":\"Food & Drink Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/hj/9724cc70-b0e4-416f-9219-35efbf25fba7.png\",\"slug\":\"food\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/ip/9252c72b-62c6-4b5b-b321-5e2ee66757b4.png\",\"subscriber_count\":15402,\"tint_color\":\"#D58530\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":{\"cents\":9000,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"is_flexible\":false},\"is_free\":false,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":false,\"spots_remaining\":12,\"is_near_capacity\":false,\"require_approval\":true},\"registration_availability\":\"open\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":false,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#151515\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":false,\"font_title\":\"roc-grotesk\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Whatever stance you hold about new technologies, you can probably agree that things are starting to get a little… \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"blurry.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"House of Madder and Ethos invite you to \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"The Most Artificial Dinner Party in the World\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" in London on October 2nd, where 40 guests will explore the most confusing question of our time: \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"where does human end and artificial begin?\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Join us for a one-night, multi-sensory experience with Chef Barney Pau,  co-hosted with Victoria Stoyanova and held in partnership with The Art House by Acrylicize.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"The guestlist is carefully curated and seats are limited - make sure to request your seat early before tickets sell out.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"–\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"* Hosts* \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"House of Madder\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/house__of__madder\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" is a boutique experiential agency specialized in madly memorable and deeply meaningful gatherings, immersive dinners and brand activations.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Ethos\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://agent.askethos.com/\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" matches people to opportunities with AI. Backed by a16z and General Catalyst, experts earn over $1M/day on the platform and access opportunities from AI model training, market research to fractional and full-time roles. Their mission is to enable every person to pursue purposeful work in the age of AI.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Victoria Stoyanova\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/victoriastoyanova/\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" is an ecosystem builder who curates little rooms at the intersection of technology and culture.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"* Collaborators * \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Barney Pau\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.barneypau.com/about\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"is a London-based culinary creative working at the intersection of food, art, and writing, translating ideas and concepts into edible experiences, from curated meals and bites to immersive tablescapes. His collaborators include Maison Margiela, Minor Figures, DAZED, Hoxton Hotel, Ffern, the Architectural Association, Delfina Foundation, and Turner Contemporary Gallery.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Ayesha Erkin\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://ayeshaerkin.com\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"is a culinary architect with a passion for designing the spaces where people gather, the food they gather around, and the stories that make the experience mean something. Her work spans across cultures and regions, and her clients include Rolls-Royce, Zegna, Qatar Museums, Soho House, and Al Serkal Foundation. \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"* Venue *\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"The Art House by Acrylicize\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.acrylicize.com/perspectives/welcome-to-the-art-house-by-acrylicize\"}},{\"type\":\"italic\"},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\" provides project, studio, and event space, all to nurture and amplify contemporary arts and culture, with a dynamic public programme spanning visual arts, performance, film, literature, music, and artist residencies.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}]}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[{\"id\":\"yu93wl5w\",\"label\":\"How did you hear about this event? If a specific person referred or invited you, please mention their name\",\"required\":false,\"question_type\":\"text\"},{\"id\":\"6pnt42r6\",\"label\":\"What company do you represent (if any)?\",\"required\":false,\"question_type\":\"company\",\"collect_job_title\":false},{\"id\":\"sr82upv2\",\"label\":\"What is your LinkedIn profile?\",\"required\":false,\"question_type\":\"linkedin\"},{\"id\":\"swi73uys\",\"label\":\"Any dietary restrictions or allergies we should know about?\",\"required\":false,\"question_type\":\"text\"}],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":false,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":{\"api_id\":\"discplace-QCcNk3HXowOR97j\",\"slug\":\"london\",\"name\":\"London\"}}",
