your creativity, learn new techniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"},{\"api_id\":\"cat-books\",\"description\":\"Bring your reading to life by joining a book club or hearing an author talk in person.\",\"event_count\":725,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/n0/5147e1e9-00cd-4ea1-86e9-e9b9ebd34ae6.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/3g/f33c0b3c-9090-40bb-b99c-875b534bcee4.png\",\"name\":\"Books\",\"page_title\":\"Book Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/rw/4ea6d3ba-0ad3-44d1-ba37-bcaab65051af.png\",\"slug\":\"books\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/bi/d328b247-9ac7-4ac1-9955-50ec16669bec.png\",\"subscriber_count\":1705,\"tint_color\":\"#D5AD37\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":{\"cents\":2500,\"currency\":\"gbp\",\"is_flexible\":false},\"is_free\":false,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":false,\"spots_remaining\":3,\"is_near_capacity\":true,\"require_approval\":false},\"registration_availability\":\"open\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":false,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#a57309\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":false,\"font_title\":\"museo\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Chapter and Vintage Books present Once Upon a Book at the British Library, hosted by Tanya Burr.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Join us on 6th October, in the magnificent King’s Library Gallery, for an evening celebrating the stories that made us fall in love with reading.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Come and talk about the classics that have brought us comfort, nostalgia and joy, enjoy a drink, and spend an evening surrounded by the British Library’s extraordinary collection after hours, with everyone taking home a stunning collector’s edition of a beloved classic.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"A chance to discover, revisit and share the books that have inspired us, in one of London’s most beautiful literary spaces.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"⏰ Tuesday 6th October, 6.30pm - 8:30pm\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"📍 King's Library Gallery, British Library, London\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"📚 Each ticket comes with a gorgeous classic book to take home\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":true,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":true,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":false,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":{\"api_id\":\"discplace-QCcNk3HXowOR97j\",\"slug\":\"london\",\"name\":\"London\"}}",
