| PT & Wellness Coach\\nFounder of GBM – Go Beyond Measure & Inner Sanctum\",\"first_name\":\"Michael\",\"last_name\":\"McNair\",\"instagram_handle\":null,\"is_verified\":false,\"linkedin_handle\":null,\"name\":\"Michael McNair\",\"tiktok_handle\":null,\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"twitter_handle\":null,\"username\":null,\"website\":null,\"youtube_handle\":null},{\"api_id\":\"usr-wt9AoiqSYA5mB4g\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/1d/b1d534e1-1ac0-4fb9-98e7-437efd4bbd2e.jpg\",\"bio_short\":\"\",\"first_name\":\"Viji\",\"last_name\":\"Mahalingam\",\"instagram_handle\":null,\"is_verified\":false,\"linkedin_handle\":null,\"name\":\"Viji Mahalingam\",\"tiktok_handle\":null,\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"twitter_handle\":null,\"username\":null,\"website\":null,\"youtube_handle\":null},{\"api_id\":\"usr-YU6oo7tOEI8Vxff\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://cdn.lu.ma/avatars-default/avatar_39.png\",\"bio_short\":null,\"first_name\":\"Karen\",\"last_name\":null,\"instagram_handle\":null,\"is_verified\":false,\"linkedin_handle\":null,\"name\":\"Karen\",\"tiktok_handle\":null,\"timezone\":\"Europe/London\",\"twitter_handle\":null,\"username\":null,\"website\":null,\"youtube_handle\":null}],\"has_available_ticket_types\":true,\"refund_policy\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"We understand that plans can change.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Tickets are fully refundable up to 14 days before the event.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Within 14 days of the event, tickets become non-refundable, but they may be transferred to another person at no additional charge.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"If we cancel or reschedule the event, you may choose either:\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"A full refund, or\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"A transfer to future date\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"If you are unable to attend due to serious illness, medical emergency, or travel disruption, please contact us and we will do our best to find a fair solution.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"guest_count\":105,\"ticket_count\":150,\"hosts\":[{\"api_id\":\"usr-XOCLGYBjG0B3CCG\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://cdn.lu.ma/avatars-default/avatar_28.png\",\"bio_short\":\"\",\"first_name\":\"Alex\",\"last_name\":\"King-Harris\",\"instagram_handle\":null,\"is_verified\":false,\"linkedin_handle\":null,\"name\":\"Alex King-Harris\",\"tiktok_handle\":null,\"timezone\":\"America/Vancouver\",\"twitter_handle\":null,\"username\":null,\"website\":null,\"youtube_handle\":null}],\"referred_by\":null,\"cover_image\":{\"colors\":[\"#0c0906\",\"#904d1b\",\"#ecc38d\"],\"palette\":{\"neutral\":[{\"color\":\"#0c0906\",\"percentage\":22.2}],\"vibrant\":[{\"color\":\"#904d1b\",\"percentage\":4.22},{\"color\":\"#ecc38d\",\"percentage\":2.35}]}},\"cover_video\":null,\"social_image\":{\"cdn_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/event-social/pj/09a50088-909b-4056-ba03-0e19b5c1261b.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630,\"mime_type\":\"image/png\"},\"social_video\":null,\"sessions\":[],\"ticket_types\":[{\"api_id\":\"ttype-gvLFqOGMayfmlOS\",\"cents\":8000,\"currency\":\"eur\",\"description\":null,\"ethereum_token_requirements\":[],\"event_api_id\":\"evt-Ph0EGnhGyRSZnXN\",\"is_flexible\":false,\"is_hidden\":false,\"max_capacity\":null,\"max_per_guest\":null,\"membership_restriction\":null,\"min_cents\":null,\"position\":\"8\",\"name\":\"Standard\",\"require_approval\":false,\"tint_color\":null,\"type\":\"fiat-price\",\"valid_end_at\":null,\"valid_start_at\":null,\"num_tickets_registered\":150,\"num_guests\":150,\"spots_remaining\":null,\"is_disabled\":false}],\"featured_infos\":[],\"categories\":[{\"api_id\":\"cat-AzVAf6VmE9JEre4\",\"description\":\"Whether it’s painting workshops or pottery classes, join an event to unleash your creativity, learn new techniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"},{\"api_id\":\"cat-C1VaNLnt25w9t6c\",\"description\":\"Discover wellness events around you. Come for a walk, yoga or meditation, learn about nutrition and longevity, and connect with other health-conscious people.\",\"event_count\":928,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/m4/a01e1e0d-17dd-40a7-ba23-db7bd120c7f3.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/y5/4f225f49-0c10-4bba-b1cb-77ae216268ac.png\",\"name\":\"Wellness\",\"page_title\":\"Wellness Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/3n/1854fdc7-af9d-4a63-a174-a9bd8dedbee2.png\",\"slug\":\"wellness\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/h4/dbbd8345-1419-4dc0-beb6-1a691ddae4fc.png\",\"subscriber_count\":19694,\"tint_color\":\"#73AFBB\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":{\"cents\":8000,\"currency\":\"eur\",\"is_flexible\":false},\"is_free\":false,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":true,\"spots_remaining\":0,\"is_near_capacity\":false,\"require_approval\":false},\"registration_availability\":\"waitlist\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#100b07\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":true,\"font_title\":\"ivy-presto\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Sandy (Breathe With Sandy) and Alex King-Harris (Rara Avis) are both composers, performers, and breathwork facilitators. They share the stage as a blended, harmonized duo — producing music, playing live instruments, and guiding the breath together as one integrated practice.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Continuing the energy from our sold out show in Los Angeles, we're bringing this experience to Europe.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Each evening begins with a cacao ceremony led by a local community collaborator, followed by live music and guided breathwork. There is time to slow down, arrive, and connect with others before and after the experience.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Drawing from both traditional pranayama and modern conscious breathing practices, Alex and Sandy create immersive soundscapes that help quiet the mind, regulate the nervous system, and support deeper states of presence and gratitude.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Our approach is simple, welcoming, and accessible to everyone. You are always encouraged to listen to your body, go at your own pace, and make the experience your own. With clear guidance and music that flows with the breath, we create a space that feels both grounded and meaningful, where science and ancient wisdom come together in a natural way.\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"Joining us on vocals for the final part of the journey is Molly-Anne Chinner is a British vocalist, sound artist and producer. Through ethereal vocals, intuitive sound and the Languages of Light, she creates immersive sonic experiences that invite listeners into deep presence, remembrance and inner stillness. Inspired by the wisdom of the natural world, sacred traditions and the archetypal symbolism of the star nations, her work explores the meeting place of music, consciousness and devotion, offering performances that are both deeply moving and profoundly restorative.  \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"(\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"https://www.instagram.com/mollyannemusic\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/mollyannemusic\"}}]},{\"text\":\")\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"What to bring:\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"• yoga mat and/or blanket + eye pillow\",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"type\":\"hard_break\"},{\"text\":\"• water or tea\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":true,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":null}",
