ash your creativity, learn new techniques, and connect with fellow makers.\",\"event_count\":3528,\"hero_image_desktop_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/54/bc5c9b4f-cbfd-4f55-84d1-331e0a12523c.png\",\"icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/u8/5eeba5a4-d305-4bc1-9017-329937813f30.png\",\"name\":\"Arts & Culture\",\"page_title\":\"Arts & Culture Events\",\"simple_icon_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/o1/12999161-f382-4d97-b2f6-281fca336c04.png\",\"slug\":\"arts\",\"social_image_url\":\"https://images.lumacdn.com/uploads/jh/3f4210d6-8dd1-4a12-ae53-adb92d49c333.png\",\"subscriber_count\":25615,\"tint_color\":\"#AEA73C\"}],\"ticket_info\":{\"price\":null,\"is_free\":true,\"max_price\":null,\"is_sold_out\":true,\"spots_remaining\":0,\"is_near_capacity\":false,\"require_approval\":true},\"registration_availability\":\"waitlist\",\"subscribed_to_calendar\":false,\"event_invite\":null,\"manager_info\":null,\"guest_info\":null,\"host_info\":null,\"sold_out\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"theme_meta\":{\"theme\":\"legacy\"},\"tint_color\":\"#c1a88d\",\"can_register_for_multiple_tickets\":false,\"font_title\":\"museo\",\"description_mirror\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"A weekend-long write-a-thon, inspired by events like \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"inkhaven\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://www.inkhaven.blog/\"}}]},{\"text\":\".\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"A space to support anyone interested in \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"integral altruism\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://integralaltruism.com\"}}]},{\"text\":\" to write stuff that feels alive in them. This is also intended to seed activity on the in-construction ‘int/a forum’, an experimental forum where new ideas on the intersection of wisdom and effectiveness can emerge.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"We encourage the writing to be on int/a topics! Feel free to follow what’s alive for you, but here are some suggestions of directions to go in:\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"ordered_list\",\"attrs\":{\"start\":{\"start\":1}},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Synthesising paradigms\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\": Compare or combine ideas from EA and liminal web or wisdom traditions. Take an EA idea and make it wise, take a liminal idea and make it effective, or combine or compare.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Putting principles into practice\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\": Take one of the (currently abstract) \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"int/a principles\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://integralaltruism.substack.com/p/some-principles-for-integral-altruism?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=reaction&utm_medium=email&utm_content=post&triedRedirect=true\"}}]},{\"text\":\" and try to make it concrete and action-guiding for a specific decision, e.g. a career choice, a funding call, a community norm.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Concrete problems in the metacrisis: \",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"text\":\"Propose a project, research direction, or career advice that brings us closer to solving the metacrisis.\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Tentative format:\",\"type\":\"text\"}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"⏱️10:00-18:00 GMT each day\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"bullet_list\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"🌅Saturday: connecting and writing together\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"📨Sunday: giving and integrating feedback, then posting on the int/a forum (& optionally elsewhere)\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"🌐 This in-person version will run in-tandem with an \",\"type\":\"text\"},{\"text\":\"online version\",\"type\":\"text\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"href\":\"https://luma.com/j43jhc3b\"}}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"list_item\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"📌 Location TBC in London (non-residential)\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Apply by registering above (not everyone who applies is guaranteed a spot)\",\"type\":\"text\"}]}]},\"eth_address_requirement\":null,\"faqs\":null,\"name_requirement\":\"full-name\",\"phone_number_requirement\":null,\"solana_address_requirement\":null,\"registration_questions\":[{\"id\":\"1vm0eevy\",\"label\":\"What are some ideas you’d be interested in writing about? (you are not committing to writing any of these by answering this question, just want to get a sense of what you’re excited about)\",\"required\":true,\"question_type\":\"long-text\"},{\"id\":\"a2feh2rn\",\"label\":\"(Optional) Give a link to any prior writings you’re proud of\",\"required\":false,\"question_type\":\"long-text\"}],\"prefilled_answers\":{},\"is_flagged\":false,\"is_managing_calendar_admin\":false,\"show_unlock_code_option\":false,\"has_multiple_ticket_types\":false,\"membership_tiers\":[],\"membership_info\":null,\"waitlist_active\":true,\"route\":null,\"featured_city\":null}",
